      "text": "Enemas:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " rectal mineral oil enema 2–11 y: 59 mL; ≥ 12 y: 118 mL, as a single dose; rectal sodium phosphate enema: ⍉ in children < 2 y."
